SUMMARY:[Natural Language Processing & LLMs][Deep Representation Learning] 
 EMNLP 2026 - ARR paper submission deadline
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: Conference on Empirical Methods in Natural La
 nguage Processing\nWebsite: https://2026.emnlp.org/\nSource URL: https://
 2026.emnlp.org/calls/main_conference_papers/\nLocation: Budapest\, Hungar
 y\nTopics: Natural Language Processing & LLMs\, Deep Representation Learn
 ing\, LLM Agents & Tool Use\, Information Retrieval & Search\nSize: XXL\n
 Submission type: Paper-based\nConfidence: confirmed\nLast checked date: 2
 026-10-07\nNotes: ARR fresh-paper submissions are closed. Commitment is o
 nly for reviewed papers and is not a new-paper route. Full conference win
 dow includes workshops. Size is an editorial estimate.\nScope: Empirical 
 methods for language modeling and NLP\, including generation\, informatio
 n extraction\, multilinguality\, dialogue\, retrieval\, and model evaluat
 ion. Interpretability\, bias\, and safety matter within language systems.
  Curated coverage emphasizes language methods and evidence rather than ev
 ery application listed in the CFP.\nAdditional topics: Explainability & I
 nterpretability\, Fairness & Responsible AI\, Robustness & Safety\, Human
 -AI Interaction & Deployment\nScope sources (2026): https://2026.emnlp.or
 g/calls/main_conference_papers/\nScope last checked: 2026-10-07
